WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.830
This is the final completion page for Module 6 The
module tracks

00:00:05.856 --> 00:00:11.898
ten knowledge checks and six coding exercises Before
selecting Complete Module review

00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:14.767
the counters and make sure they reflect the work you
intended to

00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:20.134
finish If an activity is incomplete the page will
list it and

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:25.493
let you return to the relevant slide When you select
Complete Module

00:00:25.704 --> 00:00:31.048
the page creates a Canvas submission summary That
summary includes your completion

00:00:31.075 --> 00:00:37.582
status knowledge-check answers and the SQL saved for
each coding exercise Review

00:00:37.609 --> 00:00:42.493
the summary before copying it If the module is
incomplete the page

00:00:42.506 --> 00:00:48.073
will warn you before you copy the current progress
Remember that progress

00:00:48.086 --> 00:00:53.339
is stored locally in this browser Switching devices
using a private window

00:00:53.523 --> 00:00:56.786
or clearing browser storage may not carry the saved
work with you

00:00:58.518 --> 00:01:03.283
The purpose of this final step is verification Check
the work before

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:04.047
you submit it
